1
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,375
What's someone doing here?

2
00:00:42,575 --> 00:00:43,509
Have you no decency?

3
00:00:53,175 --> 00:00:54,875
What's wrong with you?

4
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,125
You're the one who cheated!

5
00:00:57,175 --> 00:00:58,675
And now you're calling me?

6
00:01:00,275 --> 00:01:01,125
Get lost!

7
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,400
I never want to see you again!

8
00:01:03,625 --> 00:01:04,400
Get lost!

9
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:11,425
Who are you?

10
00:01:11,425 --> 00:01:12,470
Keep your hands off me!

11
00:01:13,375 --> 00:01:14,125
Hey!

12
00:01:27,484 --> 00:01:28,550
Thank you.

13
00:01:30,025 --> 00:01:30,980
Let me take you home.

14
00:01:35,550 --> 00:01:36,950
Thanks for taking me home.

15
00:01:37,050 --> 00:01:37,950
I feel much better.

16
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:50,650
How about

17
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:51,750
we exchange numbers?

18
00:01:58,025 --> 00:01:58,775
Bye.

19
00:02:02,175 --> 00:02:02,925
Honey,

20
00:02:02,975 --> 00:02:04,750
time to get up for work.

21
00:02:04,775 --> 00:02:05,525
Honey,

22
00:02:05,975 --> 00:02:07,475
I have to be at the station early.

23
00:02:07,475 --> 00:02:08,375
I've got to go.

24
00:03:15,650 --> 00:03:17,650
There are still so many loose ends.

